    "en": "Derived from the National Land Numerical Information (Administrative Areas), MLIT, Japan (https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/ksj/gml/datalist/KsjTmplt-N03-2026.html), approved by the GSI under the Survey Act (R 7JHf 351). Names and English names are based on the Local Government Codes, MIC, Japan (https://www.soumu.go.jp/denshijiti/code.html)"
